msgid "WM CRA SBOM & Vulnerability Beacon"
msgstr "WM CRA SBOM & Vulnerability Beacon"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: wm-cra-sbom-beacon.php
msgid "https://arnoldwender.com/wordpress-plugins/wm-cra-sbom-beacon/"
msgstr "https://arnoldwender.com/wordpress-plugins/wm-cra-sbom-beacon/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-cra-sbom-beacon.php
msgid ""
"CycloneDX 1.6 inventory of the code WordPress loads, /.well-known/"
"security.txt (RFC 9116) from admin settings, and advisories stored as CSAF "
"2.0 base documents. It does not assess whether the Cyber Resilience Act "
"applies."
msgstr ""
"Inventár CycloneDX 1.6 kódu načítavaného WordPressom, /.well-known/"
"security.txt (RFC 9116) z nastavení administrácie a bezpečnostné upozornenia "
"uložené ako základné dokumenty CSAF 2.0. Neposudzuje uplatniteľnosť aktu o "
"kybernetickej odolnosti."

#. Author of the plugin
#: wm-cra-sbom-beacon.php
msgid "Arnold Wender"
msgstr "Arnold Wender"

